#X text 20 38 Streaming playback \, with start and stop \, looping \, variable speed \, seeking and position reporting. The creation argument is the number of signal outlets. Default: 2 A file with a different channel count is mixed to the output channels.;
#X text 22 620 speed resamples: at speed 2 the file plays twice as fast and an octave higher. Negative speed is not supported. A file at another sample rate is resampled to Pd's rate.;
#X text 22 676 A seek past the end clamps and reads as end of file. Errors carry a reason: nofile \, format \, noopen \, seek \, underflow or array.;
#X text 22 578 open and play 1 in one message is supported. Opening a second file replaces the first and stops playback.;
#X floatatom 620 240 5 0 0 0 - - - 0;
#X text 666 241 cue \, in seconds;
